 P.; Franssen, Elske H. P.; Ehlert, Erich M. E.; Taniguchi, Masahiko; Verhaagen, Joost. Meningeal cell-derived semaphorin 3A inhibits neurite outgrowth. Molecular and Cellular Neurosciences. 2003-12-01, <b>24</b> (4): 902–912. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.worldcat.org/issn/1044-7431\"><span title=\"國際標準連續出版物號\">ISSN&#160;1044-7431</span></a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/14697657\"><span title=\"公共醫學識別碼\">PMID&#160;14697657</span></a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:12637023\"><span title=\"Semantic Scholar\">S2CID&#160;12637023</span></a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//doi.org/10.1016%2Fs1044-7431%2803%2900243-4\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016%2Fs1044-7431%2803%2900243-4\"><span title=\"數位物件識別號\">doi:10.1016/s1044-7431(03)00243-4</span></a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E7%A5%9E%E7%BB%8F%E7%AA%81&amp;rft.atitle=Meningeal+cell-derived+semaphorin+3A+inhibits+neurite+outgrowth&amp;rft.au=Ehlert%2C+Erich+M.+E.&amp;rft.au=Franssen%2C+Elske+H.+P.&amp;rft.au=Taniguchi%2C+Masahiko&amp;rft.au=Verhaagen%2C+Joost&amp;rft.aufirst=Simone+P.&amp;rft.aulast=Niclou&amp;rft.date=2003-12-01&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.issn=1044-7431&amp;rft.issue=4&amp;rft.jtitle=Molecular+and+Cellular+Neurosciences&amp;rft.pages=902-912&amp;rft.volume=24&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A12637023&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1016%2Fs1044-7431%2803%2900243-4&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F14697657&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\" class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw